### Pass rule: "the effect exists"

1. SPY overnight mean 3.87 bp, t 2.82 (need > 0, t ≥ 2.5): PASS
2. SPY overnight − intraday 1.72 bp, t 0.81 (need > 0, t ≥ 2): FAIL
3. QQQ overnight 4.93 bp, diff 2.02 bp; IWM overnight 6.04 bp, diff 7.05 bp (need all > 0): PASS
4. SPY overnight positive in 9 of 10 full years (need ≥ 7): PASS

**Effect exists: FAIL**

## 2. Strategies (each-way cost per side; Sharpe on excess of BIL)

Overnight-only and buy-and-hold are invested at every end of day, so excess = return − BIL. Intraday-only is in cash at every end of day, so it earns BIL and its excess is its return. CAGR uses 252 days a year. Skipped days are 0 for the strategies and excluded for buy-and-hold.

